# Read AGENTS.md first

This repository’s agent-oriented conventions and layout live in **`AGENTS.md`** in working/parent directories

## Requirement

1. **Before** planning non-trivial changes, or answering architecture questions about this project, **read `AGENTS.md`** with the editor/read_file tool if it is not already in your context.

Skipping `AGENTS.md` risks wrong assumptions about the app.
